SUMMARY:Sultanina (raisin) Festival\, Piskokefalo
LOCATION:Piskokefalo\, Crete (Lasithi)\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Sitia's raisin festival is held in Piskokefalo\, the sultana village 4 km south of town\, at the athletic centre on the evening of 16 August\, with raisin-based sweets and dishes\, local wine and a big Cretan stage (Grigoris Samolis in 2025). It closes the Kornaria panigiri weekend\, so it is the one to pick if you can only do one Sitia glenti\; Piskokefalo also holds a corn festival there on 19 July.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/lasithi/#piskokefalo-sultanina-raisin-festival-piskokefalo
